                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">By using and/or copying this document, or the Eclipse Foundation
    document from which this statement is linked, you (the licensee) agree
    that you have read, understood, and will comply with the following terms
    and conditions:</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
