      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" start-indent="1in" end-indent="0pt">
         <fo:block id="service.serial">
            <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
               <fo:block margin-left="0pt">
                  <fo:block font-size="24.8832pt" font-weight="bold">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                               space-before.optimum="0in"
                               space-before.minimum="0in"
                               space-before.maximum="0in"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               text-align="start"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-size="28pt"
                               line-height="35pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               space-after="24pt">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>146</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Serial Device Service Specification</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookcItalic"
                               font-size="18pt"
                               line-height="25pt">
                        <fo:basic-link internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial">
                           <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                      font-family="inherit"
                                      letter-spacing="inherit"
                                      hyphenate="inherit">Version 1.0</fo:inline>
                        </fo:basic-link>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d193e87">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Introduction</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.1</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Introduction</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Recently, OSGi is gaining popularity as an enabling technology for
    building embedded systems in the residential market as well as other
    Internet-of-Things (IoT) domains. It is expected that communication with
    various devices attached to OSGi enabled gateways will be
    necessary.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Such communication can be implemented by means of serial connection
    when using non-IP devices based on ZigBee and Z-wave protocols. The most
    typical case arises when a USB dongle that supports such protocols is
    connected to the USB port of such a device, for example, residential
    gateway. The Operating System on the gateways will recognize the dongle as
    a virtual serial device and initiate a serial communication with the
    application process.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Serial Device Service specification defines an API for
    establishing communications between an OSGi bundle and a serial device,
    such as a ZigBee coordinator or Z-Wave controller.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline color="inherit"
                          font-family="inherit"
                          letter-spacing="inherit"
                          hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline> defines the concept
    of device categories. <fo:inline color="inherit"
                          font-family="inherit"
                          letter-spacing="inherit"
                          hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline> defines a device
    category for USB devices. This specification and <fo:inline color="inherit"
                          font-family="inherit"
                          letter-spacing="inherit"
                          hyphenate="inherit">???</fo:inline> provide a solution for the USB serial use
    case.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d193e99">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>146.1.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Entities</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d193e101">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e102">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">SerialDevice</fo:inline> - This is an OSGi service
          that is used to represent a serial device. This OSGi service stores
          information regarding serial device and its status as service
          properties and provides communication function with the
          device.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e106">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">SerialEventListener</fo:inline> - A listener to
          events coming from Serial Devices.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e110">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Serial base driver bundle</fo:inline> - The bundle
          that implements <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDevice">
                                 <fo:inline color="blue"
                                            font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                            hyphenate="false">SerialDevice</fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link>. Serial base driver bundle registers
          SerialDevice services with the Framework. It provides communication
          function with the (physical) serial devices.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e116">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Refining driver bundle</fo:inline> - Refining drivers
          provide a refined view of a physical device that is already
          represented by another Device service registered with the Framework
          (see the details for Device Access Specification).</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-before.optimum="1em"
                         space-before.maximum="2em"
                         space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                         space-after.optimum="1em"
                         space-after.maximum="2em"
                         keep-together.within-column="always"
                         id="service.serial-figure-146-1">
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            font-weight="normal"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                            space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                            space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-style="italic"
                            keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block>Figure 146.1</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>Serial Device Service class diagram</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block id="d193e122" text-align="center">
                     <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.serial/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.serial/src/main/resources/spec/service_serial_classes.svg)"
                                          width="auto"
                                          height="auto"
                                          content-width="5.000in"
                                          content-height="3.750in"
                                          text-align="center"/>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d193e125">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">SerialDevice Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.2</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>SerialDevice Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDevice">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">SerialDevice</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> is the interface expressing a serial device. It
    maintains information and state of the serial device as a service
    property. It provides the communication facility with the serial device.
    Each <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDevice</fo:inline> expresses each serial device.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDevice</fo:inline> service is registered with the service
    registry with service properties as shown in the following table.</fo:block>
            <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions"
                      space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="2em"
                      keep-together.within-column="auto"
                      id="d193e135">
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         font-weight="normal"
                         font-size="9pt"
                         hyphenate="false"
                         space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                         space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                         space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                         font-style="italic"
                         keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block>Table 146.1</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Service properties of SerialDevice service</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:table border-before-width.conditionality="retain"
                         border-collapse="collapse"
                         table-layout="fixed"
                         width="100%">
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="3" column-width="proportional-column-width(4)"/>
                  <fo:table-header start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always"
                                   keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                   font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>The key of service property</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Type</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>Description</fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-header>
                  <fo:table-body start-indent="0pt" end-indent="0pt">
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">DEVICE_CATEGORY</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String[]</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">Constant for the value of the service property
            DEVICE_CATEGORY used for all Serial devices. Value is
            "Serial".</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row keep-together.within-column="always">
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">serial.comport</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell padding-start="0pt"
                                       padding-end="4pt"
                                       padding-top="1pt"
                                       padding-bottom="1pt">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">MANDATORY property key. Represents the name of the
            port. </fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">Examples: "/dev/ttyUSB0", "COM5",
            "/dev/tty.usbserial-XXXXXX"</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Serial base driver may need native libraries. This document has
    a precondition that there are native libraries. It is out of scope how to
    install native libraries.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d193e163">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">SerialEventListener Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.3</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>SerialEventListener Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Serial events are sent using the white board model, in which a
    bundle interested in receiving the Serial events registers an object
    implementing the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialEventListener">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">SerialEventListener</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> interface. A COM port name can be set to limit the
    events for which a bundle is notified.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d193e169">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">USB Serial Example</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.4</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>USB Serial Example</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Serial base driver registers a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDevice">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">SerialDevice</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
    service that represents a (physical) Serial device. If the device is USB
    Serial device, then it is recommended that the base driver implements
    <fo:inline color="blue"
                          font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em"
                          hyphenate="false">???</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDevice</fo:inline> concurrently, and
    registers the service under <fo:inline color="blue"
                          font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em"
                          hyphenate="false">???</fo:inline>
    and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDevice">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">SerialDevice</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> interfaces.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d193e183">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Security</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.5</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Security</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">To acquire the Serial device service, the refining bundle need that
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[SerialDevice, GET]</fo:inline> are assigned.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">To receive the Serial events, the bundles need that
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[SerialEventListener, REGISTER]</fo:inline> are
    assigned.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
               <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDevice</fo:inline> service should only be implemented by
    trusted bundles. This bundle requires
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[SerialDevice, REGISTER]</fo:inline> and
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">ServicePermission[SerialEventListener, GET]</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.serial">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">org.osgi.service.serial</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>146.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>org.osgi.service.serial<fo:inline id="org.osgi.service.serial-version"/>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
Serial Device Service Specification Package Version 1.0.

 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Bundles wishing to use this package must list the package in the
 Import-Package header of the bundle's manifest. This package has two types of
 users: the consumers that use the API in this package and the providers that
 implement the API in this package.

 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Example import for consumers using the API in this package:
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.serial; version="[1.0,2.0)"}</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d193e211">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>146.6.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Summary</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d193e213">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e214">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialConstants">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialConstants</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
Constants for serial device settings.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e222">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDevice">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDevice</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
SerialDevice is a service representing a device performing serial
 communication.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e230">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialDeviceException">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialDeviceException</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
A exception used to indicate that a serial device communication problem
 occurred.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e238">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialEvent">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialEvent</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
A serial device event.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d193e246">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.serial.SerialEventListener">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">SerialEventListener</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
Serial events are sent using the white board model, in which a bundle
 interested in receiving the Serial events registers an object implementing
 the SerialEventListener interface.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
